#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:2
msgid "Stretch Clusters & Witness Nodes"
msgstr "Stretch Clústeres & Witness Nodes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:7
msgid ""
"A stretch cluster extends an HVM 1.3 cluster across two physical sites with "
"a witness node in a third location for tie-breaking arbitration. This "
"provides site-level fault tolerance while maintaining a single cluster "
"management domain."
msgstr ""
"Un stretch cluster extends un HVM 1.3 cluster a través de two physical sites"
" con un witness nodo en un third location para tie-breaking arbitration. "
"Este proporciona site-nivel fault tolerance mientras maintaining un single "
"cluster gestión domain."

